{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Pandamaster_0","id":"292531828592738304","is_bot":0,"username":"pandamaster_1"},"author_id":"292531828592738304","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"\"well, there are two common risks... Many people on leave of the fey wild can... lose all memory of being there. And then theres the... TIME DISTORTION, when you leave the feywild.. time is affected quite drastically, it can be minues or days, sometimes you can be in there for years and its just been a week... Or youre in there for a week and its been years...\" he says precautiously","created_at":"2021-08-28T00:58:48.041000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880979698950225930","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"\"Oh... wow...\" Jigsaw thinks on this \"I... Still have some business to do on this plane. Roy has asked for help on a project and...\" They look down at Mike playing in their lap \"I'd like to help him and his family get back on their feet... But after that, I'm not sure if there's much left for me to do here.\" They pause to think again, \"Oh and I'll have to get better at writing everything down. I would hate to loose my memory of our adventures in the feywild\" they give a wide mischievous grin.","created_at":"2021-08-28T01:14:05.750000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880983548100767764","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Pandamaster_0","id":"292531828592738304","is_bot":0,"username":"pandamaster_1"},"author_id":"292531828592738304","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"\"I think i still have some buisness here too, i just\" he realizes you just said yes to joining him \"ii.. i thought i would tell those at ferrytown that we have at least one trip there and maybe bring themm with us so they may go home\" he stutters through his sentence","created_at":"2021-08-28T01:26:39.975000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880986711549702194","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
